#. settings-schema.json->monitor-brightness->description
msgid "Control external monitor brightness"
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->monitor-brightness->tooltip
msgid ""
"For monitors on a cable, which have no kernel backlight. Needs ddcutil "
"installed and permission on /dev/i2c-*, and is only used on machines with no"
" built-in backlight of their own."
msgstr ""

